  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maritime SAR IV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sj&#xF6;r&#xE4;ddning SAR IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maritime Search and Rescue (SAR) in the Baltic Sea States is undergoing rapid development in accordance with IMO recommendations. Regional co-operation in the area has improved and SAR agreements are being negotiated. However, it is vital to upgrade the capacity to co-ordinate major SAR cases and to perform cross-border operations. The current project (phIV) consist of 6-weeks joint training in Ark&#xF6;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sj&#xF6;r&#xE4;ddningen i &#xD6;stersj&#xF6;n har uppvisat stora framsteg under senare &#xE5;r. Det finns dock fortfarande brister vad avser gemensamma  gr&#xE4;ns&#xF6;verskridande operationer och agerande i h&#xE4;ndelse av sv&#xE5;rare och st&#xF6;rre olyckor. Detta projekt, det 4e i en serie av 5, best&#xE5;r i gemensam avancerad sj&#xF6;r&#xE4;ddningsutbildning p&#xE5; Ark&#xF6; f&#xF6;r deltagare fr&#xE5;n alla &#xD6;stersj&#xF6;l&#xE4;nder, organiserat av Sj&#xF6;fartsverket.</narrative>
  </description>
